    LLM: "Game: Yukon Hold'em. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.",
    Player: "Yukon Hold'em is a Texas Hold'em variant with TWO separate flops. 2 hole cards + 7 community cards (2 flops of 2, 2 turns, 1 river). At showdown, choose ONLY ONE of 2 community card sets to combine with hole cards. Best 5-card hand wins.",
